:attr:`vec`.

If :attr:`input` is a :math:`(n \times m)` tensor, :attr:`vec` is a 1-D tensor of
size :math:`m`, :attr:`out` will be 1-D of size :math:`n`.

.. note:: This function does not :ref:`broadcast <broadcasting-semantics>`.

