Ex) Rule 21 (primitive type variable should not be zero)
    {v_1 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≠ 0

[Example Rules]
Rule 18 (input tensor is empty or only contains non-negative values)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 0) ∨ min(v_1) ≥ 0

Rule 21 (primitive type variable should not be zero)
{v_1 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≠ 0

Rule 23 (3-dimensional tensor with all positive shape dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0

Rule 25 (tensor shape matches given tuple shape)
